I eat the whole cake.
I am very thirsty now.
I want some plain water.
I look towards the counter.
A waiter comes that way.
I look at him.
"Brother," I call.
He comes near my table.
"Can you give me a glass of water?" I ask.
"Do you want normal water?" he asks.
"No, can I get some cold water?" I ask.
"Okay, I will bring it now," he says.
"Thank you very much," I say.
He leaves from there.
